<title>BRAZIL: Soy shipping conditions at Brazil's Santos port.</title>
<headline>Soy shipping conditions at Brazil's Santos port.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santos port reported the following conditions for shipments of soybeans and soymeal:</p>
<p>Vessels: Ziemia Krakowska continues loading 19,000 tonnes soymeal. Tomis Future loading 50,000 tonnes soybeans.</p>
<p>Road: 303 trucks arrived Wednesday of which 292 were carrying soybeans and nine soymeal (the rest was citrus meal).</p>
<p>Rail: 39 wagons arrived Wednesday carrying soymeal.</p>
<p>Stocks: 73,241 tonnes soybeans, 1,278 tonnes soymeal.</p>
<p>((--Joelle Diderich, Sao Paulo newsroom +55 11 248 5417))</p>
